cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this checklist or runner, please cite it as below."
title: "Agentic AI Test Checklist 110 and agentest runner"
authors:
  - family-names: Padmanabhuni
    given-names: Srinivas
    affiliation: "AiEnsured (testAIng.com)"
type: software
abstract: "agentest is an open-source, offline, deterministic test runner for AI agents. It runs 130 executable checks (the 110 tests of the Agentic AI Test Checklist plus 20 repository extensions) on an agent's OpenTelemetry GenAI traces, A2A AgentCard and MCP tools list, with no LLM judge. Maintained by Dr Srinivas Padmanabhuni, CTO and Co-founder, AiEnsured (testAIng.com). Contact: srinivas AT testAIng.com"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/srpadmanabhuni/agentest"
url: "https://srpadmanabhuni.github.io/agentest/"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23597877
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23614376
    description: "Agentic AI Assurance Test Catalogue, Consolidated Edition (source of the test text)"
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23597877
    description: "Agentic AI Test Checklist 110, all versions (Zenodo concept DOI; resolves to the latest version)"
keywords: [agentic-ai, ai-agents, agent-testing, ai-testing, ai-safety, llm-evaluation, llm-security, prompt-injection, opentelemetry, mcp, a2a, responsible-ai]
